{"id":"4a7917fe7476291ae1946054a4469d5af0038fbd","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1257042","title":"Claude 代充跳 kyc 被封都是不退款的吗","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Tory12138","excerpt":"Claude - @Tory12138 - 有走代充的朋友吗，可以讲一下么","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"topic-replies\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/代充\"><li></li> 代充</a><a href=\"/tag/退款\"><li></li> 退款</a><a href=\"/tag/封\"><li></li> 封</a></P><p><span>17 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-11-15 10:28:33 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18291003\" data-reply-id=\"18291003\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f8d0/1045/102641_normal.png?m=1641529094\" alt=\"milkleeeeee\" data-uid=\"102641\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>1</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>据我所知，都是这样。</p><p>现在代充一般都要求先过 kyc 才给你代充吧，你估计是在这之前找的代充，但代充本身就是无售后的，因为 claude 本身太容易封号了</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18291120\" data-reply-id=\"18291120\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f8d0/1045/102641_normal.png?m=1641529094\" alt=\"milkleeeeee\" data-uid=\"102641\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>3</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/Tory12138\">Tory12138</a> #2 你购买 max 5x 的时候（可能要先输入信用卡再点购买） 100% 会弹 kyc</p><p>有代充店铺用这种方式帮你提 kyc 链接（注意，仅仅只是帮你主动触发 kyc ，不是帮你过 kyc ），3 块钱</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18291475\" data-reply-id=\"18291475\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/837c7adad2a92281f9a4b84e00b1dace?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"microscopec\" data-uid=\"688419\"><